1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,968
A parabola has eccentricity one: every point is exactly as far from the focus as from the directrix.

2
00:00:07,968 --> 00:00:18,789
Put the focus at a, zero and the directrix at x equals minus a. Move P along the curve: the yellow and red lengths are always equal.

